<title>ITALY: SOCCER-FIORENTINA 0 BENFICA 1 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FIORENTINA 0 BENFICA 1 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>FLORENCE, Italy 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benfica of Portugal beat Fiorentina of Italy 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in their European Cup Winners' Cup quarter-final second leg match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Edgar Pacheco 22</p>
<p>Fiorentina won 2-1 on aggregate</p>
